'''Mystic Mask Yulala''' (謎仮面のウララー, ''Nazo Kamen no Urarā'', '''Mysterious Mask Urara''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in the [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 40|40th]] floor of the [[Heavenly Tower]]. Defeating him on Floor 40 will unlock his [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] counterpart [[Masked Yulala (Special Cat)|Masked Yulala]] via [[Catnip Challenges]]. He was added in [[Version 6.7 Update|Version 6.7]].

