==Enemy==
Mystic Mask Yulala moves very fast and stands at 200 range but can hit cats up to 400 range. Combined with his guaranteed chance to warp cats far back, low time between attacks, and considerably high DPS, he can be a truly monstrous pushing force against those unprepared to deal with him. [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Macho]], [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Cleanerbot Cat]], [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Macho Glass Cat]] and other [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless Cats]] help a lot at stalling and defeating him.

