==Trivia==
*His design may be a reference to the character [[wikia:snk:Mudman|Mudman]] from the ''[[wikia:snk:World Heroes (series)|World Heroes]]'' series.
*He is [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master Uril]]'s son. Mystic Mask Yulala's Japanese description calls him the head of his clan, and [[Master Uril (Enemy)|enemy Master Uril]]'s Japanese description says he passed down that same title to his son when he retired.
*It is heavily implied that [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun]] is the daughter of Yulala, as they both wear masks, have the same white hair. Seem to use the same attack and they both appear in the final stage of ZL 4 the Ururuvu Journals. [[Masked Yulala (Special Cat)|Masked Yulala]] also mentions "his 12-year old daughter" in his Evolved Form's description, while his Japanese True Form descriptions mentions him becoming colorful to grab his adolescent daughter's attention. Ururun Cat's description says that her father is a school teacher and Mystic Mask Yulala's description states that he teaches modern dance to kindergartners, further hinting that he is Ururun's dad. Their Normal Forms' descriptions also state that both Yulala and Ururun will "join those who have defeated them," suggesting that they all follow the family tradition of joining those who have defeated them.
*Mystic Mask Yulala, [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] and [[Hanasaka Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Hanasaka Cat]] all have similar movement animations.

